<body>
    <h1>Facilitated Switching between IdPs for Single-Sign On (SSO) In IGEL=
 OS 12.2</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <h2 id=3D"FacilitatedSwitchingbetweenIdPsforSingle-SignOn(SSO)InIGE=
LOS12.2-Overview">Overview</h2>
<p>Switching between Okta and <span class=3D"legacy-color-text-blue3">Micro=
soft Entra ID</span> has been facilitated with IGEL OS 12.2.</p>
<p>With IGEL OS 12.01, the behavior of the SSO configuration was as follows=
: When you wanted to switch the IdP between Okta and <span class=3D"legacy-=
color-text-blue3">Microsoft Entra ID</span>, you had to delete and re-enter=
 the public client identifier and the secret every time. This goes back to =
the fact that these values were not stored as separate parameters on the de=
vice.</p>
<p>With IGEL OS 12.2 or higher, the SSO configuration has been optimized. T=
he public client identifiers and the secrets are now handled separately for=
 Okta and <span class=3D"legacy-color-text-blue3">Microsoft Entra ID</span>=
. To benefit from this improvement, the profile must be based on IGEL OS 12=
.2.&nbsp;</p>
<div class=3D"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-war=
ning">
<span class=3D"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-error confluence-inform=
ation-macro-icon"></span>
<div class=3D"confluence-information-macro-body">
<h3 id=3D"FacilitatedSwitchingbetweenIdPsforSingle-SignOn(SSO)InIGELOS12.2-=
AutomaticUpdateResultsinBrokenSSO">Automatic Update Results in Broken SSO</=
h3>
<p>If your devices have been updated because <strong>Auto-update Default Ve=
rsion to newest version</strong> is active (see <em>Universal Management Su=
ite &gt; IGEL UMS Web App &gt; Apps - Import and Configure Apps for IGEL OS=
 12 Devices via the IGEL UMS Web App &gt; Updating IGEL OS Apps &gt; How to=
 Configure Update Settings for Apps in the IGEL UMS Web App</em>), and the =
SSO settings are still defined by a profile for IGEL Base System 12.01, SSO=
 will not function anymore. In this case, you must immediately create an ap=
propriate profile for IGEL OS Base System 12.2, as described in this articl=
e.&nbsp;</p>
</div>
</div>
<p></p>
<div class=3D"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-war=
ning">
<span class=3D"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-error confluence-inform=
ation-macro-icon"></span>
<div class=3D"confluence-information-macro-body">
<h3 id=3D"FacilitatedSwitchingbetweenIdPsforSingle-SignOn(SSO)InIGELOS12.2-=
ImportantMeasuresforDevicesthatRetainBaseSystem12.01">Important Measures fo=
r Devices that Retain Base System 12.01</h3>
<p>If some of your devices are to keep IGEL OS Base System 12.01, ensure th=
e following:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>The current SSO profile is set to version 12.01.x of the IGEL OS Base Sy=
stem, not to the default version. This is done by setting the <strong>App S=
elector</strong> to version <strong>12.01</strong>.x explicitly. If the bas=
e system version remains set to the default version, and the default versio=
n is then set to 12.2 or higher, the settings will be lost when the profile=
 is saved.</p></li>
<li>
<p>The current SSO profile (based on IGEL OS Base System 12.01) remains ass=
igned to those devices.</p></li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
<h2 id=3D"FacilitatedSwitchingbetweenIdPsforSingle-SignOn(SSO)InIGELOS12.2-=
SettingUpaNewProfileforEasyIdPSwitchingSettingUpYourProfiles">Setting Up a =
New Profile for Easy IdP Switching<span class=3D"confluence-anchor-link" id=
=3D"FacilitatedSwitchingbetweenIdPsforSingle-SignOn(SSO)InIGELOS12.2-Settin=
gUpYourProfiles"><span class=3D"confluence-anchor-link" id=3D"SettingUpYour=
Profiles"></span></span></h2>
<ol start=3D"1">
<li>
<p>In the UMS Web App, create a new profile for the IGEL OS Base System bas=
ed on version 12.2. This can be done by setting the profile's <strong>App S=
elector</strong> to version <strong>12.2.0</strong> explicitly or by settin=
g the base system's default version to 12.2 and the&nbsp;profile's <strong>=
App Selector</strong> to <strong>Default version</strong>.<br></p></li>
<li>
<p>For your Okta configuration, go to <strong>Security &gt;&nbsp; Logon &gt=
; Single Sign-On</strong> and edit the settings as follows:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Enable&nbsp;<strong>Single Sign-On with Identity Provider</strong>.</p><=
/li>
<li>
<p>Set&nbsp;<strong>Identity Provider</strong>&nbsp;to&nbsp;<strong>Okta</s=
trong>.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Provide the&nbsp;<strong>Okta URL</strong>&nbsp;for your user. This is t=
he Okta organization URL. Example: "https://mycompany.okta.com"</p></li>
<li>
<p>Provide the <strong>Client ID</strong>.&nbsp;<span class=3D"legacy-color=
-text-default">This is the client ID that was created in Okta.</span></p></=
li>
<li>
<p>Provide the&nbsp;<strong>Client secret</strong>.<br></p><span class=3D"c=
onfluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-ma=
nual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image confluence-content-image=
-border image-center" width=3D"468" loading=3D"lazy" src=3D"cae932c8cdc19c1=
c1da94a6dda95faf3f92ab4e5d3caa3da69919f317424ae8a" data-image-src=3D"https:=
//igel-jira.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/73302437/image-2023-9-1=
4_10-29-12.png?version=3D1&amp;modificationDate=3D1716364688711&amp;cacheVe=
rsion=3D1&amp;api=3Dv2" data-height=3D"684" data-width=3D"1023" data-unreso=
lved-comment-count=3D"0" data-linked-resource-id=3D"73308624" data-linked-r=
esource-version=3D"1" data-linked-resource-type=3D"attachment" data-linked-=
resource-default-alias=3D"image-2023-9-14_10-29-12.png" data-base-url=3D"ht=
tps://igel-jira.atlassian.net/wiki" data-linked-resource-content-type=3D"im=
age/png" data-linked-resource-container-id=3D"73302437" data-linked-resourc=
e-container-version=3D"5" data-media-id=3D"070c2634-2b1c-4831-9673-d9b9c5fb=
b43d" data-media-type=3D"file" height=3D"312"></span>
<p></p></li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p>For your <span class=3D"legacy-color-text-blue3">Microsoft Entra</span>&=
nbsp;configuration, go to <strong>Security &gt;&nbsp; Logon &gt; Single Sig=
n-On</strong> and edit the settings as follows:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Enable&nbsp;<strong>Single Sign-On with Identity Provider</strong>.</p><=
/li>
<li>
<p>Set&nbsp;<strong>Identity Provider</strong>&nbsp;to&nbsp;<strong>Azure I=
D</strong>.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Enter the&nbsp;<strong>Azure AD Tenant Name/ID</strong>.&nbsp;<span clas=
s=3D"legacy-color-text-default">This is the value you have obtained as&nbsp=
;</span><strong><span class=3D"legacy-color-text-default">Directory (tenant=
) ID</span></strong><span class=3D"legacy-color-text-default">&nbsp;in the =
</span><span class=3D"legacy-color-text-blue3">Microsoft Entra </span><span=
 class=3D"legacy-color-text-default">Portal.</span></p></li>
<li>
<p>Set the appropriate&nbsp;<strong>Application (client) ID</strong>. This =
is the value you have obtained as&nbsp;<strong>Application (client) ID</str=
ong>&nbsp;in your <span class=3D"legacy-color-text-blue3">Microsoft Entra I=
D</span>&nbsp;Portal.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Enter the&nbsp;<strong>Client secret</strong>.</p>
<div class=3D"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-not=
e">
<span class=3D"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-warning confluence-info=
rmation-macro-icon"></span>
<div class=3D"confluence-information-macro-body">
<p>The secret for <span class=3D"legacy-color-text-blue3">Microsoft Entra I=
D</span>&nbsp;can only be viewed once. If you have not stored it, you need =
to generate a new one.&nbsp;</p>
</div>
</div><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper =
confluence-embedded-manual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image co=
nfluence-content-image-border image-center" width=3D"468" loading=3D"lazy" =
src=3D"08620ffb1fc8d11d3c755d12f37972ac762d78adc9e98e43bd6e2c99f6a19bba" da=
ta-image-src=3D"https://igel-jira.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/7=
3302437/image-2023-9-14_10-34-13.png?version=3D1&amp;modificationDate=3D171=
6364688701&amp;cacheVersion=3D1&amp;api=3Dv2" data-height=3D"685" data-widt=
h=3D"1022" data-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-linked-resource-id=3D"7=
3308896" data-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-linked-resource-type=3D"at=
tachment" data-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"image-2023-9-14_10-34-13.pn=
g" data-base-url=3D"https://igel-jira.atlassian.net/wiki" data-linked-resou=
rce-content-type=3D"image/png" data-linked-resource-container-id=3D"7330243=
7" data-linked-resource-container-version=3D"5" data-media-id=3D"d1384291-5=
a9c-40f9-8fac-31b532608f46" data-media-type=3D"file" height=3D"313"></span>=
</li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p>Assign this profile to all relevant devices.<br></p></li>
<li>
<p>If you want to switch between Okta and <span class=3D"legacy-color-text-=
blue3">Microsoft Entra ID</span>, simply select the appropriate <strong>Ide=
ntity Provider</strong>:</p><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper=
 image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size"><img class=3D"conflu=
ence-embedded-image confluence-content-image-border image-center" width=3D"=
468" loading=3D"lazy" src=3D"bbc808468f8dc42a72ba81fc25f9580edeec8e84496de8=
49b438413439cb21c4" data-image-src=3D"https://igel-jira.atlassian.net/wiki/=
download/attachments/73302437/image-2023-9-14_10-39-9.png?version=3D1&amp;m=
odificationDate=3D1716364688690&amp;cacheVersion=3D1&amp;api=3Dv2" data-hei=
ght=3D"684" data-width=3D"1023" data-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-li=
nked-resource-id=3D"73308899" data-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-linke=
d-resource-type=3D"attachment" data-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"image-=
2023-9-14_10-39-9.png" data-base-url=3D"https://igel-jira.atlassian.net/wik=
i" data-linked-resource-content-type=3D"image/png" data-linked-resource-con=
tainer-id=3D"73302437" data-linked-resource-container-version=3D"5" data-me=
dia-id=3D"67620d02-7917-4d98-930d-e568cef280a4" data-media-type=3D"file" he=
ight=3D"312"></span></li>
</ol>
<p><br></p>
    </div>
</body>
